## 7. Dataset and Stress Tests

The dataset contains 139 balanced synthetic reports modeled on the style of published FDA Enforcement Reports and USDA FSIS alerts.

| Category | Examples |
|---|---|
| Biological | Listeria, Salmonella, E. coli, Norovirus |
| Allergen | Undeclared milk, peanuts, wheat, shellfish |
| Physical | Glass, plastic, metal filings, wood splinters |
| Chemical | Phthalates, lead, mercury, pesticide residues |

The dataset includes adversarial examples to expose failure modes. These examples are for evaluation design and do not represent actual reported incidents.

