## 11. Extending the System

Potential improvements include:

- Replacing or supplementing synthetic examples with carefully curated public recall notices.
- Adding multi-label hazard classification and explicit human-review escalation.
- Using sentence-transformer embeddings instead of GPT-2 centroid embeddings.
- Adding a retrieval layer that links predictions to source examples and rationale.
- Expanding stress tests for negation, causality, source attribution, and temporal context.

---

## 12. Future Work

With more time, I would validate the taxonomy with food-safety subject-matter experts, measure performance on a held-out public dataset, and redesign the output around multi-label classification plus human-review queues rather than a single dominant label.
